@startuml requirements_moscow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #2B2D42
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #2B2D42
}

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #EDF2F4
    BorderColor #2B2D42
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #2B2D42
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 13
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2B2D42
    FontColor #2B2D42
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:16><b>MicroShield - Requirements Prioritization & Architectural Boundaries (MoSCoW)</b></size>\n

actor "Taddeo Pallabà\n(Firmware Engineer)" as Taddeo
actor "Zanni Giorgioni\n(OT Security Engineer)" as Zanni

rectangle "<b>MUST HAVE (Core Operational Foundation)</b>\n--\n<b>Functional Requirements (FR)</b>\n• <b>FR-01:</b> Line-rate Packet Interception (UART/SPI/MAC)\n• <b>FR-02:</b> Deterministic Feature Extraction\n• <b>FR-03:</b> Transpiled Decision Tree Evaluation (C99)\n• <b>FR-04:</b> Forward Benign & Quarantine Malicious Frames\n--\n<b>Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)</b>\n• <b>NFR-01:</b> Bounded Latency (WCET <= 50 µs @ 168 MHz)\n• <b>NFR-02:</b> Zero Dynamic Allocation (Heap-less C99)\n• <b>NFR-03:</b> Computational & Energy Transparency (< 1% CPU)" as MUST #FFFFFF

rectangle "<b>SHOULD HAVE (Supervisory MLOps & Resilience)</b>\n--\n<b>Functional Requirements (FR)</b>\n• <b>FR-05:</b> Serial Telemetry Frame Dispatch\n• <b>FR-06:</b> Supervisory Queue Ingestion & Ring Buffering\n• <b>FR-07:</b> Concept Drift Monitoring (> 5% Ambiguity Trigger)\n• <b>FR-08:</b> Automated C-Header Transpiler Pipeline\n--\n<b>Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)</b>\n• <b>NFR-04:</b> Intrinsic Explainability (Rule & Threshold ID)\n• <b>NFR-05:</b> Diagnostic Channel Integrity (CRC32 Framing)" as SHOULD #FFFFFF

actor "Lentina Gigi\n(Plant Manager)" as Lentina

rectangle "<b>COULD HAVE (Visualization & Tooling)</b>\n--\n<b>Functional Requirements (FR)</b>\n• <b>FR-09:</b> Interactive Web Dashboard (Dash/Plotly)\n• <b>FR-10:</b> Synthetic Benchmark Playback Harness\n--\n<b>Non-Functional & Regulatory Attributes</b>\n• <b>NFR-06:</b> Strict Typing (PEP 484/526, mypy, black)\n• <b>Compliance:</b> Audit Trail for EU CRA & NIS 2" as COULD #FFFFFF

rectangle "<b>WON'T HAVE (Architectural Negative Requirements)</b>\n--\n<b>Deliberate Design Exclusions</b>\n• <b>NR-01: On-Chip Model Training</b>\n  <i>Excluded by design: prevents CPU starvation & power drain</i>\n--\n• <b>NR-02: Hardware-Accelerated TLS Decryption</b>\n  <i>Delegated to host network stack / crypto-coprocessor</i>" as WONT #F1F3F5

' Collegamenti attori ai quadranti
Taddeo -down-> MUST : Enforces Determinism\n& Zero-Heap Limits
Zanni -down-> SHOULD : Supervises Drift\n& Decision Rules
Lentina -right-> COULD : Verifies Metrics\n& CRA/NIS 2 Posture

' Vincoli di griglia 2x2
MUST -[hidden]right-> SHOULD
MUST -[hidden]down-> COULD
COULD -[hidden]right-> WONT
SHOULD -[hidden]down-> WONT

@enduml
